#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:54
msgid "GPU Allocation Strategy"
msgstr "混合分配策略"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:56
msgid ""
"The current policy is *Idle First*: The scheduler always attempts to "
"assign replicas to the least utilized GPU. Use the "
"``XINFERENCE_LAUNCH_STRATEGY`` parameter to choose launch strategy."
msgstr ""
"当前策略为 *空闲优先* ：调度器始终尝试将副本分配至最空闲的GPU。使用 ``XINFERENCE_LAUNCH_STRATEGY`` "
"参数选择启动策略。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:59
msgid "Set Environment Variables"
msgstr "设置环境变量"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:63
msgid ""
"Sometimes, we want to specify environment variables for a particular "
"model at runtime. Since v1.8.1, Xinference provides the capability to "
"configure these individually without needing to set them before starting "
"Xinference."
msgstr ""
"有时我们希望在运行时为特定模型指定环境变量。从 v1.8.1 开始，Xinference 提供了单独配置环境变量的功能，无需在启动 "
"Xinference 前设置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:66
msgid "For Web UI."
msgstr "针对 Web UI。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:72
msgid ""
"When using the command line, use ``--env`` to specify an environment "
"variable."
msgstr "命令行使用时，使用 ``--env`` 指定环境变量。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:74 ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:123
msgid "Example usage:"
msgstr "示例用法："

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:80
msgid ""
"Take vLLM as an example: it has versions V1 and V0, and by default, it "
"automatically determines which version to use. If you want to force the "
"use of V0 by setting ``VLLM_USE_V1=0`` when launching a model, you can "
"specify this during model launching."
msgstr ""
"以 vLLM 为例，它有 V1 和 V0 两个版本，默认会自动判定使用哪个版本。如果想在加载模型时强制通过设置 ``VLLM_USE_V1=0``"
" 来使用 V0，可以指定该环境变量。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:84
msgid "Configuring Model Virtual Environment"
msgstr "配置模型虚拟空间"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:88
msgid ""
"For this part, please refer to :ref:`toggling virtual environments and "
"customizing dependencies <model_launching_virtualenv>`."
msgstr "对于这部分，请参考 :ref:`开关虚拟空间和定制依赖 <model_launching_virtualenv>`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:91
msgid "Batching / Continuous Batching"
msgstr "批处理 / 连续批处理"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:93
msgid ""
"Xinference supports batching for higher throughput. For LLMs on the "
"``transformers`` engine, continuous batching is available and can be "
"enabled via environment variables at launch time."
msgstr ""
"Xinference支持批处理以提升吞吐量。对于基于 ``transformers`` "
"引擎的大型语言模型，可启用连续批处理功能，该功能可在启动时通过环境变量进行配置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:96
msgid "Key settings:"
msgstr "关键设置："

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:98
msgid ""
"``XINFERENCE_BATCH_SIZE`` and ``XINFERENCE_BATCH_INTERVAL`` for general "
"batching behavior."
msgstr "``XINFERENCE_BATCH_SIZE`` 和 ``XINFERENCE_BATCH_INTERVAL`` 用于控制常规的批处理行为。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:101
msgid "Example (LLM, transformers):"
msgstr "示例（大型语言模型，Transformers）："

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:114
msgid ""
"For detailed behavior, supported models, and aborting requests, see "
":ref:`Continuous Batching <user_guide_continuous_batching>`."
msgstr ""
"有关详细行为、支持的模型以及中止请求的信息，请参阅"
" :ref:`连续批处理 <user_guide_continuous_batching>` 。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:118
msgid "Thinking Mode"
msgstr "思考模式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:120
msgid ""
"Some hybrid reasoning models (for example, Qwen3) support an optional "
"*thinking mode*. You can enable this at launch time via ``--enable-"
"thinking``."
msgstr "某些混合推理模型（例如Qwen3）支持可选的 *思考模式* 。您可在启动时通过 ``--enable-thinking`` 参数启用该功能。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:171
msgid "Launch Configuration History"
msgstr "启动配置历史"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:173
msgid ""
"After a model is launched successfully from the Web UI, Xinference stores its "
"launch configuration in the Supervisor launch-history database and keeps a "
"user-scoped browser cache for fast access and temporary network failures. When "
"the deployment dialog is opened again, the newest server-backed configuration "
"is restored unless the user has already started editing the form."
msgstr "模型从 Web UI 成功启动后，Xinference 会将启动配置保存到 Supervisor 的启动历史数据库中，并按用户在浏览器中保留一份缓存，方便快速访问，也能应对短暂的网络故障。再次打开部署窗口时，会恢复服务端保存的最新配置；如果您已经开始编辑表单，则不会覆盖正在修改的内容。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:180
msgid ""
"The configuration history dialog can remove records owned by the current user. "
"Records used by automatic startup are protected from deletion. In authenticated "
"deployments, browser caches are separated by the username in the access token; "
"configuration data owned by another user is not placed in that cache."
msgstr "在配置历史窗口中，您可以删除自己的记录，但用于自动启动的记录不能删除。启用身份验证时，浏览器缓存会按访问令牌中的用户名隔离，不会混入其他用户的配置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:306
msgid ""
"The history dialog also lists configurations owned by the current user for "
"other model names. These records are never applied automatically. After the "
"user confirms **Use as Template**, Xinference keeps the current model name, "
"removes the previous model UID and history or automatic-startup metadata, and "
"copies the remaining launch options into the form without starting a model."
msgstr "历史窗口也会列出您在其他模型上保存的配置，但不会自动套用。确认 **用作模板** 后，Xinference 会保留当前模型名称，去掉原来的模型 UID、历史记录和自动启动相关信息，再将其余启动选项填入表单。这个操作只填写配置，不会启动模型。"

msgid "Download without launching"
msgstr "仅下载模型，不启动"

msgid "Open a model's deployment dialog and choose **Download only** beside the **Deploy** button. It downloads the same model artifacts used by deployment, but does not reserve GPUs, create model subprocesses, install a virtual environment, or load a model into memory."
msgstr "打开模型的部署窗口，点击 **部署** 旁边的 **仅下载**，就能提前下载部署所需的模型文件。这个操作不会占用 GPU、创建模型子进程、安装虚拟环境，也不会把模型加载到内存中。"

msgid "The REST endpoint is ``POST /v1/cache/models``. Supply ``cache_uid`` when the client needs to query progress or cancel the operation while the POST request is still running."
msgstr "对应的 REST 接口是 ``POST /v1/cache/models``。如果需要在请求尚未结束时查询进度或取消下载，请传入 ``cache_uid``，用它来标识这次下载任务。"

msgid "Progress and cancellation use the same ``cache_uid``:"
msgstr "查询进度和取消下载时，使用同一个 ``cache_uid``："

msgid "Cache-only downloads can also be paused and resumed:"
msgstr "仅下载任务也可以暂停和恢复："

msgid "Xinference persists unfinished cache-only download tasks. If the supervisor or worker stops unexpectedly, an active task is shown as ``interrupted`` after restart and can be resumed with the same endpoint. Resume reuses files already present in the model hub cache. Byte-range continuation of a partially written file depends on the selected hub client; otherwise that incomplete file is downloaded again."
msgstr "Xinference 会保存尚未完成的仅下载任务。如果 Supervisor 或工作节点意外停止，重启后，正在进行的任务会显示为 ``interrupted`` （已中断），可以通过上述恢复接口继续下载。恢复时会复用模型仓库缓存中已有的文件。下载了一部分的文件能否断点续传，取决于所选模型仓库的客户端；如果不支持，这个未完成的文件会重新下载。"

msgid "``GET /v1/downloads`` lists active, paused, interrupted, and failed downloads. Pause and resume apply to cache-only downloads. A model launch that happens to be downloading still uses the launch cancellation endpoint because pausing a launch would also need to preserve its runtime allocation state."
msgstr "``GET /v1/downloads`` 会列出正在下载、已暂停、已中断和失败的任务。暂停和恢复只适用于仅下载任务。如果是在启动模型的过程中下载文件，仍需使用启动取消接口，因为暂停整个启动过程还涉及保留已分配的运行资源。"

msgid "In a distributed deployment, ``worker_ip`` can select the worker whose local cache receives the files. If it is omitted, the supervisor selects one worker."
msgstr "在分布式部署中，可以通过 ``worker_ip`` 指定把文件下载到哪个工作节点的本地缓存。不指定时，Supervisor 会选择一个工作节点。"

msgid "Per-replica placement"
msgstr "为每个副本指定运行位置"

msgid "For distributed deployments, ``replica_config`` can pin every replica to a specific worker and optional GPU indexes. Worker addresses must use the full registered ``IP:port`` value. The number of entries must equal ``replica`` and each entry currently supports exactly one worker."
msgstr "在分布式部署中，可以用 ``replica_config`` 为每个副本指定工作节点，也可以进一步指定 GPU 编号。工作节点地址必须使用注册时的完整 ``IP:port``。配置条目数必须与 ``replica`` 一致，目前每个条目只能指定一个工作节点。"

msgid "The same placement can be supplied to ``xinference launch`` as a JSON array:"
msgstr "在命令行中，也可以将相同的位置配置作为 JSON 数组传给 ``xinference launch``："

msgid "``--replica_config`` remains available as a compatibility alias, but ``--replica-config`` is recommended. If ``--replica`` is omitted, the CLI derives it from the number of array entries. If it is supplied explicitly, it must equal that number."
msgstr "为兼容旧用法，``--replica_config`` 仍然可用，但建议使用 ``--replica-config``。如果省略 ``--replica``，命令行会按数组条目数确定副本数量；如果显式指定，则必须与条目数一致。"

msgid "``replica_config`` is mutually exclusive with the model-level ``worker_ip``, ``n_gpu``, and ``gpu_idx`` arguments, and with ``n_worker > 1``. The CLI therefore rejects ``--replica-config`` together with ``--worker-ip``, ``--gpu-idx``, a non-``auto`` ``--n-gpu``, or ``--n-worker`` greater than 1. Each replica currently targets exactly one worker. If ``replica_uid`` is omitted, Xinference assigns the stable default ``{model_uid}-{replica_index}`` (for example, ``my-model-0``). Omit ``gpu_idx`` and use ``n_gpu=\"auto\"`` to let the selected worker allocate GPUs automatically."
msgstr "``replica_config`` 不能与模型级的 ``worker_ip``、``n_gpu``、``gpu_idx`` 参数同时使用，也不支持 ``n_worker > 1``。因此，命令行不允许将 ``--replica-config`` 与 ``--worker-ip``、``--gpu-idx``、非 ``auto`` 的 ``--n-gpu`` 或大于 1 的 ``--n-worker`` 一起使用。目前，每个副本只能指定一个工作节点。如果省略 ``replica_uid``，Xinference 会使用稳定的默认名称 ``{model_uid}-{replica_index}``，例如 ``my-model-0``。省略 ``gpu_idx`` 并设置 ``n_gpu=\"auto\"``，则由选定的工作节点自动分配 GPU。"

msgid "Running models can be scaled by one or more replicas in a single operation. The new replicas reuse the existing launch configuration by default. You can override their model engine and device allocation without changing existing replicas. Placement is optional; if omitted, the supervisor selects a worker automatically."
msgstr "对于正在运行的模型，可以一次增加一个或多个副本。新副本默认复用已有的启动配置，您也可以单独调整新副本的引擎和设备分配，不影响已有副本。运行位置可以不指定，此时由 Supervisor 自动选择工作节点。"

msgid "For multiple replicas, ``replica_config`` may also be a list with one placement entry per new replica. If any replica in a multi-replica scale-up fails to launch, Xinference rolls back the replicas created by that operation."
msgstr "一次增加多个副本时，``replica_config`` 也可以是一个列表，为每个新副本提供一条位置配置。如果其中任何一个副本启动失败，Xinference 会回滚本次操作创建的副本。"

msgid "Scale-up is not supported for Xavier-distributed models or models launched with ``n_worker > 1``. Deleting the last replica terminates the running model."
msgstr "使用 Xavier 分布式运行的模型，以及通过 ``n_worker > 1`` 启动的模型，暂不支持增加副本。删除最后一个副本时，运行中的模型也会终止。"

msgid "During deployment, the progress endpoint ``GET /v1/models/{model_uid}/progress`` reports a stage for each replica. After model files finish downloading, a replica can report ``waiting_for_dependencies`` while another launch prepares its shared virtual environment, then ``installing_dependencies`` while packages are being installed, and ``loading`` after the environment is ready."
msgstr "部署期间，进度接口 ``GET /v1/models/{model_uid}/progress`` 会报告每个副本所处的阶段。模型文件下载完成后，如果另一个启动任务正在准备共享虚拟环境，副本会报告 ``waiting_for_dependencies``；安装依赖包时报告 ``installing_dependencies``；环境就绪后报告 ``loading``。"

msgid "The Web UI shows each replica's file download details inside its replica card."
msgstr "Web 界面会在各副本的卡片中显示该副本的文件下载详情。"

msgid "During dependency installation, each replica's progress includes the number of packages planned for the main install and the number already present in its virtual environment. A replica waiting for a shared environment has no install count of its own. If the installer cannot resolve a reliable plan, the count is omitted."
msgstr "安装依赖包期间，每个副本的进度会显示主安装任务计划安装的包数量，以及其虚拟环境中已有的包数量。等待共享环境的副本没有自己的安装计数。如果安装器无法解析出可靠的计划，则不显示计数。"

msgid "The Web UI keeps the dependency installation result visible while a replica is loading. When no dependency installation is needed, the replica card says so."
msgstr "副本加载模型时，Web 界面仍会显示依赖包的安装结果。如果本次无需安装依赖包，副本卡片也会明确提示。"

#: doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid ""
"For image and video models, batching depends on the selected native engine "
"and model. Diffusers does not use a Xinference step-level scheduler. See "
":ref:`image` and :ref:`video`."
msgstr ""
"图像和视频模型的批处理能力取决于所选原生引擎和模型。Diffusers 不使用 Xinference 自研的逐步调度器。请参阅 :ref:`image`"
" 和 :ref:`video`。"

#: ../../../Users/xuyeqin/.codex/worktrees/worker-handoff/inference/doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst:490
msgid "Reconfigure and upgrade running models"
msgstr "重新配置和升级运行中的模型"

#: ../../user_guide/launch.rst:417
msgid ""
"GPU weight retention defaults to automatic selection: supported model "
"environments and configurations enable it; unsupported configurations start "
"normally. Omit ``enable_weight_cache`` or pass ``None`` for automatic "
"selection, set ``True`` to require retention, or ``False`` to disable it. In"
" the deployment dialog, **Keep GPU weights for reload** offers **Auto**, "
"**Enabled** and **Disabled**. Retention requires vLLM 0.31.0+ or SGLang "
"0.5.21+, Linux with CUDA or ROCm, one worker, one replica, and fixed tensor "
"parallelism. Models with retained weights cannot add replicas."
msgstr ""
"GPU 权重保留默认自动选择：模型环境和配置支持时自动开启，不支持时正常启动。省略 ``enable_weight_cache`` 或传入 "
"``None`` 表示自动选择，设为 ``True`` 表示必须开启，设为 ``False`` 则关闭。部署对话框中的 **保留 GPU "
"权重以支持重载** 提供 **自动**、**开启** 和 **关闭** 三种选择。此功能需要 vLLM 0.31.0+ 或 SGLang "
"0.5.21+、Linux CUDA 或 ROCm、单 Worker、单副本以及固定的张量并行度。已保留权重的模型不能追加副本。"

#: ../../../Users/xuyeqin/.codex/worktrees/worker-handoff/inference/doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst:496
msgid ""
"With retained weights enabled, Xinference prepares a replacement model "
"process while the current engine keeps serving. The replacement shares "
"compatible cached weights and builds its own KV cache and CUDA graphs. New "
"requests switch only after loading and a health check succeed; existing "
"requests, including streams, finish on their original engine. Failed "
"preparation leaves the current engine serving. The model UID and GPU "
"reservation stay the same. Terminating the model releases its processes and "
"cached weights."
msgstr ""
"启用权重保留后，Xinference 会在原引擎继续服务的同时准备新的模型进程。新进程共享兼容的缓存权重，并创建自己的 KV 缓存和 CUDA "
"Graph。只有加载和健康检查成功后，新请求才切换过去；已有请求（包括流式请求）仍由原引擎完成。准备失败时，原引擎继续服务。模型 UID 和 GPU "
"预留保持不变。终止模型会释放相关进程和缓存权重。"

#: ../../../Users/xuyeqin/.codex/worktrees/worker-handoff/inference/doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst:498
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/models/{model_uid}/reload`` accepts a partial ``model_config`` "
"object and optional ``python_executable`` and ``drain_timeout`` fields. It "
"returns HTTP 202 with an ``operation_id``. Poll ``GET "
"/v1/models/{model_uid}/reload`` until ``status`` is ``ready`` or ``error``. "
"On error, ``restored=true`` means the previous engine is serving. Query "
"``GET /v1/models/{model_uid}/reload/config`` for supported parameters, "
"current values, engine version and Python executable. Invalid patches return"
" HTTP 400; a reload already in progress returns HTTP 409. ``drain_timeout`` "
"controls the wait for parser-only updates (default 300 seconds, maximum "
"3600); engine replacements never force existing requests to stop."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/models/{model_uid}/reload`` 接受部分 ``model_config``，以及可选的 "
"``python_executable`` 和 ``drain_timeout`` 字段，返回 HTTP 202 和 "
"``operation_id``。轮询 ``GET /v1/models/{model_uid}/reload``，直到 ``status`` 为 "
"``ready`` 或 ``error``。发生错误时，``restored=true`` 表示原引擎仍在服务。通过 ``GET "
"/v1/models/{model_uid}/reload/config`` 查询支持的参数、当前值、引擎版本和 Python 可执行文件。无效参数返回"
" HTTP 400；已有重新加载操作时返回 HTTP 409。``drain_timeout`` 控制仅修改解析器时的请求等待时间（默认 300 "
"秒，最大 3600 秒）；替换引擎不会强制停止已有请求。"

#: ../../user_guide/launch.rst:423
msgid "vLLM supports changing ``max_num_seqs``, ``max_num_batched_tokens``, ``max_model_len``, ``gpu_memory_utilization`` and ``enforce_eager``."
msgstr "vLLM 支持修改 ``max_num_seqs``、``max_num_batched_tokens``、``max_model_len``、``gpu_memory_utilization`` 和 ``enforce_eager``。"

#: ../../user_guide/launch.rst:425
msgid "SGLang supports changing ``max_running_requests``, ``max_prefill_tokens``, ``context_length``, ``chunked_prefill_size``, ``mem_fraction_static``, ``disable_cuda_graph``, ``cuda_graph_max_bs_decode``, ``cuda_graph_max_bs_prefill`` and ``schedule_conservativeness``."
msgstr "SGLang 支持修改 ``max_running_requests``、``max_prefill_tokens``、``context_length``、``chunked_prefill_size``、``mem_fraction_static``、``disable_cuda_graph``、``cuda_graph_max_bs_decode``、``cuda_graph_max_bs_prefill`` 和 ``schedule_conservativeness``。"

#: ../../../Users/xuyeqin/.codex/worktrees/worker-handoff/inference/doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst:528
msgid ""
"Parallelism, GPU placement, model path, precision, quantization and weight-"
"layout options cannot change through reload. Pipeline/data parallelism, "
"multi-worker deployments, LoRA, speculative decoding, weight offloading and "
"PD deployments are not supported by this integration yet. Quantized models "
"must pass the upstream IPC compatibility checks. For vLLM, multi-GPU caching"
" uses its native multiprocessing executor. In the running-model detail page,"
" choose **Reconfigure / upgrade model** to edit the supported values and "
"follow progress."
msgstr ""
"并行度、GPU 放置、模型路径、精度、量化和权重布局选项不能通过重新加载修改。此集成尚不支持流水线/数据并行、多 "
"Worker、LoRA、推测解码、权重卸载和 PD 部署。量化模型必须通过上游 IPC 兼容性检查。vLLM 的多 GPU "
"缓存使用其原生多进程执行器。在运行中模型的详情页，选择 **重新配置 / 升级模型** 来修改支持的值并查看进度。"

msgid "LLM constraints also accept positive integers ``context_length`` (text input plus output tokens) and ``concurrency``, and non-negative integers ``vision_tokens`` (encoded image tokens per sequence) and ``prefix_cache_bytes`` (additional retained cache across the instance). Omitting ``context_length`` uses each candidate's registered maximum context, including encoded image tokens. Models without a known maximum remain unverified. Recommended vLLM ``max_model_len`` and SGLang ``context_length`` equal text plus vision tokens per sequence. llama.cpp uses ``n_parallel=concurrency`` and ``n_ctx=(context_length + vision_tokens) * concurrency`` because its context is divided across slots. The Web UI applies these advanced launch parameters. Other workload fields affect estimates rather than request limits. Older workers that do not support workload options are retried without them and remain unverified, with a version warning. Image workloads require vision metadata. For multiple images, ``vision_tokens_per_image`` specifies their maximum encoded token count; zero assumes all image tokens belong to one image. Cached states grow with concurrency, while model weights are counted once. CUDA profiles for vLLM and SGLang share a 16,384-token prefill workspace profile with fused attention and sampled-row logits."
msgstr "LLM 约束还接受正整数 ``context_length``（文本输入加输出 tokens）和 ``concurrency``，以及非负整数 ``vision_tokens``（每个序列编码后的图像 tokens）和 ``prefix_cache_bytes``（整个实例额外保留的缓存）。省略 ``context_length`` 时，使用各个候选模型注册的最大 context，编码后的图像 tokens 也计入这个上限。最大值未知的模型仍保持未验证。推荐的 vLLM ``max_model_len`` 和 SGLang ``context_length`` 等于每个序列的文本加图像 tokens。llama.cpp 使用 ``n_parallel=concurrency`` 和 ``n_ctx=(context_length + vision_tokens) * concurrency``，因为 context 会在各个槽位间分配。Web UI 会应用这些高级启动参数。其他工作负载字段影响估算，不设置请求限制。不支持工作负载选项的旧 worker 会去掉这些选项后重试，其候选保持未验证，并附带版本警告。图像工作负载需要视觉元数据。 多个图像可通过 ``vision_tokens_per_image`` 指定单个图像编码后的最大 token 数；零表示将全部图像 tokens 视为一个图像。缓存状态随并发增加，模型权重只计算一份。vLLM (CUDA) 和 SGLang 共用 16,384-token 的预填充工作区估算，使用融合注意力和采样行 logits。"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst:95
msgid "Unified LLM context length"
msgstr "统一 LLM 上下文长度"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst:97
msgid "Set ``context_length`` in the launch API or use ``--context-length`` in the CLI to choose the input plus output token limit per request. In the Web UI, use the context slider or enter an exact integer; **Model default** clears the override. The slider's upper bound comes from the registered model. Context selections are preserved in configuration history and passed to the recommendation API."
msgstr "在启动 API 中设置 ``context_length``，或在 CLI 中使用 ``--context-length``，指定每个请求的输入加输出 token 上限。在 Web UI 中使用上下文滑动条，或输入精确整数；**模型默认值** 会清空覆盖值。滑动条上限取自注册模型。上下文选择会保存在配置历史中，并传给推荐 API。"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst:103
msgid "The launch layer maps this setting to vLLM's ``max_model_len``, SGLang, Transformers and MLX's ``context_length``, and llama.cpp's ``n_ctx=context_length*n_parallel`` total slot capacity. Existing engine parameters still work; contradictory unified and native values are rejected. Omitting the setting preserves engine defaults. This setting does not extend the model's positional embeddings or enable context scaling."
msgstr "启动层会映射到 vLLM 的 ``max_model_len``，SGLang、Transformers 和 MLX 的 ``context_length``，以及 llama.cpp 的总槽位容量 ``n_ctx=context_length*n_parallel``。原有引擎参数仍可使用，但统一值与原生值矛盾时会拒绝。省略此设置会保留引擎默认行为。此设置不会扩展模型的位置嵌入，也不会启用上下文缩放。"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "Recommendation configs expose ``context_length`` as the total per-request budget, including encoded image tokens. llama.cpp also returns ``n_parallel`` to match the estimated concurrency; the launch layer maps the unified budget to each engine."
msgstr "推荐配置通过 ``context_length`` 返回每个请求的总 token 上限，包括编码后的图像 tokens。llama.cpp 还返回 ``n_parallel``，与估算的并发数一致；启动层会把统一上限映射到各个引擎。"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "With an explicit context limit, MLX rejects prompts that leave no room for output and caps ``max_tokens`` to the remaining budget. Cached prompt tokens and processed image tokens count toward the input limit. Non-streaming requests that exceed the input limit return HTTP 400; streaming requests report an SSE error without starting generation."
msgstr "显式设置上下文上限后，MLX 会拒绝没有剩余输出空间的提示词，并把 ``max_tokens`` 限制在剩余 token 预算内。缓存命中的提示词 tokens 和处理后的图像 tokens 都计入输入上限。非流式请求超出输入上限时返回 HTTP 400；流式请求通过 SSE 报告错误，不会开始生成。"

#: ../../../Users/xuyeqin/.codex/worktrees/worker-handoff/inference/doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst:520
msgid ""
"For reasoning-capable models, both engines also accept ``reasoning_content``"
" through the same reload API. This changes only the Xinference reasoning "
"parser and leaves the engine and GPU weights intact. It works without "
"``enable_weight_cache`` or the minimum engine versions required for weight "
"retention. Existing requests, including streams, finish before the new "
"setting is applied; new requests wait until the parser change is applied. "
"The ``hot_parameters`` field in reload metadata lists these settings; "
"``enabled`` still indicates launch-time weight retention. Hot updates also "
"require one worker and one replica. ``weights_reused`` is true only when an "
"engine rebuild uses retained weights."
msgstr ""
"对于支持推理的模型，两个引擎也接受通过相同重新加载 API 修改 ``reasoning_content``。此操作只修改 Xinference "
"的推理解析器，保持引擎和 GPU 权重不变，无需启用 "
"``enable_weight_cache``，也不受权重保留所需最低引擎版本的限制。已有请求（包括流式请求）先完成，再应用新设置；新请求等待解析器修改完成。重新加载元数据中的"
" ``hot_parameters`` 列出这些设置，``enabled`` 仍表示启动时是否保留权重。热更新也要求单 "
"Worker、单副本。只有重建引擎并复用保留权重时，``weights_reused`` 才为 true。"

msgid ""
"For vLLM vision models launched with weight retention, "
"``limit_mm_per_prompt`` can change a positive image count to another "
"positive count, for example ``{\"image\": 8}``. Unspecified modality limits "
"are preserved in the engine, recovery and automatic-startup configuration. "
"The engine is rebuilt to apply multimodal memory profiling and cache budgets"
" while reusing the retained weights. Setting the image count to zero or "
"enabling images from an initially disabled encoder is rejected; limits for "
"other modalities cannot change through this operation."
msgstr ""
"对于启动时启用了权重保留的 vLLM 视觉模型，``limit_mm_per_prompt`` 支持将正数图片上限改为另一个正数，例如 "
"``{\"image\": "
"8}``。未指定的模态限制会保留在引擎、恢复及自动启动配置中。引擎会重建以重新进行多模态显存分析并设置缓存预算，同时复用保留的权重。不支持将图片数量设为零，也不支持为初始已禁用的编码器启用图片；此操作不能修改其他模态的限制。"

msgid "To change reasoning parsing without restarting the engine:"
msgstr "无需重启引擎即可修改思考内容解析："

msgid ""
"For a vision model launched with weight retention and a positive image "
"limit:"
msgstr "对于启动时启用了权重保留且图片上限为正数的视觉模型："

msgid ""
"For SGLang vision models launched with weight retention, "
"``limit_mm_data_per_request`` accepts a partial image-count patch, for "
"example ``{\"image\": 8}``. The engine is rebuilt with retained weights so "
"the new tokenizer process applies the limit. Other modality limits are "
"preserved in the engine, recovery and automatic-startup configuration. An "
"initially unlimited or zero image count can become a positive count because "
"this setting only validates request counts; it does not disable the vision "
"encoder. New image limits must be positive integers. Returning to an "
"unlimited or zero image count requires relaunching the model. With an "
"initial zero image count, Xinference skips SGLang's default image warmup."
msgstr ""
"对于启用权重保留的 SGLang 视觉模型，``limit_mm_data_per_request`` 接受部分图片数量配置，例如 "
"``{\"image\": 8}``。引擎使用保留的权重重建，由新的 tokenizer "
"进程应用数量限制。其他模态限制会保留在引擎、故障恢复和自动启动配置中。初始不限数量或图片数量为零时，都可以改为正数，因为此设置仅校验请求中的数量，不会禁用视觉编码器。新的图片数量上限必须为正整数。"
" 如需恢复为不限数量或零张图片，必须重新启动模型。 初始图片数量为零时，Xinference 会跳过 SGLang 默认的图片预热。"

msgid ""
"To change the image count of a SGLang vision model launched with weight "
"retention:"
msgstr "修改启用权重保留的 SGLang 视觉模型的图片数量上限："

#: ../../user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "Updating the model catalog"
msgstr "更新模型目录"

#: ../../user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "On the **Launch Model** page, choose the model type beside **Update**. **Update** refreshes the whole category. Choose **Update one model** and enter the exact Hub model name (or world family name) to update just that model, including a model not yet listed. Other catalog entries are preserved. This updates shared metadata without downloading weights or restarting running models. With authentication enabled, both actions require administrator or ``models:register`` permission."
msgstr "在 **模型启动** 页面中，选择 **更新** 旁的模型类型。 **更新** 会刷新整个类别。选择 **更新单个模型**，输入 Hub 中准确的模型名称（或 world 模型族名称），即可仅更新该模型，也支持尚未出现在列表中的模型。其他目录条目会保留。此操作仅更新共享元数据，不会下载权重或重启运行中的模型。启用认证时，两种操作都要求管理员或 ``models:register`` 权限。"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst:12
msgid ""
"The LMDeploy backend has been removed because its Xinference integration is "
"no longer maintained. For InternVL models, select vLLM or Transformers "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"LMDeploy 后端已移除，因为其 Xinference 集成已无人维护。使用 InternVL 模型时，请选择 vLLM 或 "
"Transformers。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "Model favorites"
msgstr "模型收藏"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "Stars on the **Launch Model** page are saved for the current account and survive browser changes and server restarts. Favorites are identified by model name across model categories. Reading or changing favorites requires ``models:list`` permission. Without authentication, all visitors share one collection. With authentication enabled, changes require a user session; API keys can only read."
msgstr "**启动模型** 页面的星标会保存到当前账号，切换浏览器或重启服务器后仍然保留。不同模型类别按模型名称识别收藏。读取或修改收藏需要 ``models:list`` 权限。未启用认证时，所有访问者共用一份收藏。 启用认证时，修改收藏需要用户会话；API key 只能读取。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "Favorites use a ``model_favorites`` table in the selected authentication database. With the default SQLite backend, this is ``<XINFERENCE_HOME>/auth/auth.db`` (configured by ``XINFERENCE_AUTH_DB_PATH``). Without authentication, the same path stores the shared collection and only the favorites table is initialized."
msgstr "收藏保存在所选认证数据库的 ``model_favorites`` 表中。默认 SQLite 后端使用 ``<XINFERENCE_HOME>/auth/auth.db`` (通过 ``XINFERENCE_AUTH_DB_PATH`` 配置)。未启用认证时，同一路径保存共享收藏，且只初始化收藏表。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "Old browser favorites are not imported automatically because they have no account identity. Choose **Import browser favorites** to add them to the current account. The browser copy is retained if any write fails or the account changes during import; retrying does not create duplicates."
msgstr "旧浏览器收藏没有账号身份，因此不会自动导入。选择 **导入浏览器收藏**，可将其添加到当前账号。如果任意写入失败，或导入期间切换了账号，浏览器中的副本会保留；重试不会产生重复记录。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "``GET /v1/model_favorites`` returns a list of model names for the authenticated account. ``PUT`` and ``DELETE`` on the same path accept ``{\"model_name\": \"org/model\"}`` to add or remove one name. Both operations are idempotent. The server derives the owner from authentication; clients cannot choose another owner."
msgstr "``GET /v1/model_favorites`` 返回当前认证账号收藏的模型名称列表。在同一路径使用 ``PUT`` 或 ``DELETE``，请求体为 ``{\"model_name\": \"org/model\"}``，可添加或移除单个名称。两种操作均为幂等操作。服务端根据认证确定所有者，客户端不能指定其他所有者。"

#: ../../../Users/xuyeqin/.codex/worktrees/worker-handoff/inference/doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst:500
msgid ""
"Both engines need runtime memory during the switch: shared weights do not "
"share KV cache or CUDA graphs. Reserve enough GPU memory for both engines. "
"Before starting a replacement, Xinference checks free memory while "
"preserving the current engine's configured budget, and rejects insufficient "
"memory or unavailable driver process accounting. Both Xinference "
"environments, and the version that originally launched the model, must "
"support seamless model replacement."
msgstr ""
"切换期间，两个引擎都需要运行显存：共享权重不会共享 KV 缓存或 CUDA Graph。请为两个引擎预留足够的 GPU 显存。两个 Xinference"
" 环境以及最初启动模型的版本，都必须支持模型无中断替换。 启动替代引擎前，Xinference "
"会检查空闲显存，并为原引擎保留配置的显存预算；显存不足或无法获取驱动进程显存信息时会拒绝操作。"

#: ../../../Users/xuyeqin/.codex/worktrees/worker-handoff/inference/doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst:502
msgid ""
"To change the model environment, set ``python_executable`` to an installed "
"absolute Python path on the Worker machine. The target must already contain "
"Xinference and the model engine; packages are not installed by reload. "
"Compatible engine and PyTorch versions reuse the retained weights. Different"
" versions use a separate weight cache and need additional GPU memory; "
"upstream compatibility checks remain enabled. In the Web UI, use "
"**Reconfigure / upgrade model** in the running model's detail view."
msgstr ""
"要更换模型环境，将 ``python_executable`` 设置为 Worker 机器上已安装的 Python 绝对路径。目标环境必须预先安装 "
"Xinference 和模型引擎；重新加载不会安装软件包。兼容的引擎和 PyTorch 版本会复用保留的权重。不同版本使用独立的权重缓存，需要额外的 "
"GPU 显存；上游兼容性检查仍然启用。在 Web 界面中，进入运行中模型的详情页，使用 **重新配置 / 升级模型**。"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst:502
msgid "Insufficient memory never triggers an in-place rebuild. Even models launched with the default 0.9 memory fraction need enough spare memory for replacement; otherwise reload fails while inference continues on the current engine."
msgstr "显存不足时不会自动退回原地重建。即使模型以默认的 0.9 显存比例启动，也需要为替换预留足够空间；否则重新加载失败，当前引擎继续处理推理。"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst:504
msgid "For consecutive upgrades, ``drain_timeout`` also bounds waiting for previous engine retirement. A timeout leaves current requests running; a later upgrade retries failed retirement."
msgstr "连续升级时，``drain_timeout`` 也会限制等待前一个引擎退出的时间。超时不会停止当前请求；后续升级会重试失败的清理操作。"

#: ../source/user_guide/launch.rst:506
msgid "When authentication is enabled, selecting ``python_executable`` requires administrator access. The current interpreter path is only included in reload metadata for administrators."
msgstr "启用认证时，选择 ``python_executable`` 需要管理员权限。只有管理员获取的重新加载元数据包含当前解释器路径。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid "``GET /v1/cache/models`` includes ``model_type`` and ``model_engine`` for each cached model. The engine list reports candidates discovered on the worker that owns its files, including that worker's virtual environment setting. Rerank and world cache versions identify only the model name, so their candidates are not checked against a cached format. ``null`` means the metadata is unknown or discovery failed; an empty list means no matching engine is currently discoverable. Listing caches does not download weights, prepare environments, or launch models."
msgstr "``GET /v1/cache/models`` 为每个缓存模型返回 ``model_type`` 和 ``model_engine``。引擎列表报告文件所属 Worker 发现的候选引擎，并遵循该 Worker 的虚拟环境设置。rerank 和 world 的缓存版本只标识模型名称，因此这些类型的候选引擎不按缓存格式校验。``null`` 表示元数据未知或引擎发现失败；空列表表示当前未发现匹配的引擎。查询缓存不会下载权重、准备环境或启动模型。"

#: ../../user_guide/launch.rst:509 ../../user_guide/launch.rst:514
msgid "Configure GPU weight retention before deploying the model."
msgstr "部署模型前配置 GPU 权重保留。"

#: ../../user_guide/launch.rst:516 ../../user_guide/launch.rst:521
msgid "Open model reconfiguration from Running Models."
msgstr "在「运行中的模型」页面打开重新配置。"

#: ../../user_guide/launch.rst:523 ../../user_guide/launch.rst:528
msgid "Open Reconfigure / upgrade model from the model's detail view."
msgstr "在模型详情页选择「重新配置 / 升级模型」。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:9
msgid "On **Running Models**, choose **Clear failed record** to remove a failed launch after its runtime has been cleaned up. You can also use ``DELETE /v1/models/{model_uid}``. This clears the status record and keeps cached model files. With authentication enabled, the operation requires ``models:write`` permission."
msgstr "在 **运行模型** 页面，选择 **清除失败记录**，可移除运行资源已清理的启动失败记录。也可以调用 ``DELETE /v1/models/{model_uid}``。此操作只清除状态记录，保留已缓存的模型文件。启用身份认证时，需要 ``models:write`` 权限。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:11
msgid "An initial launch remains cancellable until all its replicas finish, even when some are already ready. **Cancel launch** on **Running Models** calls ``POST /v1/models/{model_uid}/cancel`` to stop pending work and remove replicas created by that launch. ``GET /v1/models/instances`` reports ``can_cancel_launch`` for this operation. Scale-up of an established model does not enable initial-launch cancellation."
msgstr "首次启动在全部副本完成前始终可以取消，即使部分副本已经就绪。在 **运行模型** 页面点击 **取消启动**，会调用 ``POST /v1/models/{model_uid}/cancel``，停止尚未完成的工作，并移除本次启动创建的副本。``GET /v1/models/instances`` 通过 ``can_cancel_launch`` 标识是否支持此操作。已运行模型的扩容不会启用首次启动取消操作。"

msgid ""
"Set ``context_length`` in the launch API or use ``--context-length`` in the CLI to "
"choose the input plus output token limit per request. In the Web UI, use the context "
"slider or enter an exact integer; **Model default** clears the override. The slider "
"starts at the model's native context length. For models and engines with a registered"
" YaRN recipe, its upper bound includes the verified extension range. Hover over the "
"question mark beside **Context length** to see the native length, extension limit, "
"and whether automatic YaRN is supported by the selected engine. Context selections "
"are preserved in configuration history and passed to the recommendation API."
msgstr ""
"在启动 API 中设置 ``context_length``，或在 CLI 中使用 ``--context-length``，可选择每个请求的输入与输出 token "
"总上限。Web UI 支持拖动上下文滑块或输入精确整数；**模型默认值** 会清除覆盖设置。滑块默认选中模型原生上下文长度。模型和引擎已登记 YaRN "
"配置时，上限包含已核实的扩展范围。将鼠标悬停在 **上下文长度** 旁的问号上，可查看原生长度、扩展上限和所选引擎是否支持自动 "
"YaRN。上下文选择会保存在配置历史中，并传给配置推荐 API。"

msgid ""
"The launch layer maps this setting to vLLM's ``max_model_len``, SGLang, Transformers "
"and MLX's ``context_length``, and llama.cpp's ``n_ctx=context_length*n_parallel`` "
"total slot capacity. Existing engine parameters still work; contradictory unified and"
" native values are rejected. Omitting the setting preserves engine defaults."
msgstr ""
"启动层将此设置映射到 vLLM 的 ``max_model_len``，SGLang、Transformers 和 MLX 的 ``context_length``，以及"
" llama.cpp 的总槽位容量 "
"``n_ctx=context_length*n_parallel``。已有引擎参数仍可使用；统一参数与原生参数冲突时会被拒绝。省略该设置会保留引擎默认值。"

msgid ""
"Selecting a length within the native window leaves RoPE unchanged. Selecting"
" a longer length enables YaRN at model launch, with the scaling factor "
"rounded up from the requested length divided by the native length (for "
"example, 524,288 tokens uses a factor of 2 and 1,000,000 tokens uses a "
"factor of 4 for a 262,144-token model). The required environment flag is "
"applied only to the model process. The automatic limit is 1,010,000 tokens "
"for Qwen3.5, Qwen3.6, and Qwen3.8-Max, and 1,000,000 tokens for Qwen3.8-27B "
"and Qwen3.8-Flash-Next. Explicit RoPE overrides and already-scaled "
"checkpoint configurations take precedence. Models without a registered "
"recipe retain their existing engine behavior. Changing the selected length "
"requires restarting the model; the engine does not switch scaling per "
"request."
msgstr ""
"所选长度在原生窗口内时不修改 RoPE。超过原生长度时，会在模型启动时启用 YaRN，扩展倍数为所选长度除以原生长度后向上取整（例如，原生长度为 "
"262,144 tokens 时，524,288 tokens 使用 2 倍，1,000,000 tokens 使用 4 "
"倍）。所需环境变量只作用于模型进程。Qwen3.5、Qwen3.6 和 Qwen3.8-Max 的自动扩展上限为 1,010,000 "
"tokens；Qwen3.8-27B 和 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 为 1,000,000 tokens。手工 RoPE 覆盖和已扩展的 "
"checkpoint 配置优先。未登记配置的模型保留已有引擎行为。修改所选长度需要重启模型；引擎不会按请求切换扩展配置。"

msgid "To launch Qwen3.8-27B with automatic YaRN extension to one million tokens:"
msgstr "以下命令使用自动 YaRN 将 Qwen3.8-27B 的上下文扩展到一百万 tokens："

#: ../user_guide/launch.rst:180
msgid ""
"For models with a registered YaRN recipe, weight-cache reload cannot "
"increase the current context length. Deploy a new model to increase it so "
"the checkpoint and RoPE settings are checked again."
msgstr ""
"对于已登记 YaRN 配置的模型，使用权重缓存重载时不能增加当前上下文长度。如需增加，请重新部署模型，以便再次检查 checkpoint 和 RoPE "
"设置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:541
msgid ""
"The default for ``enable_weight_cache`` changed from ``False`` to automatic "
"selection (``None``)."
msgstr "``enable_weight_cache`` 的默认值从 ``False`` 改为自动选择（``None``）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:152
msgid "Unified context length in the launch API, CLI, and Web UI."
msgstr "在启动 API、CLI 和 Web UI 中统一配置上下文长度。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:171
msgid "Automatic YaRN context extension for models with a registered recipe."
msgstr "为已登记配置的模型提供自动 YaRN 上下文扩展。"

msgid ""
"Automatic YaRN is available for Qwen3.5, Qwen3.6, and Qwen3.8 through vLLM, "
"SGLang, MLX, and llama.cpp where the corresponding model format is "
"registered. Qwen3.8-Flash-Next supports vLLM and SGLang; SGLang requires "
"version 0.5.22 or later."
msgstr ""
"对于已登记相应模型格式的 Qwen3.5、Qwen3.6 和 Qwen3.8，vLLM、SGLang、MLX 和 llama.cpp 均可使用自动 "
"YaRN。Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 支持 vLLM 和 SGLang；SGLang 需要 0.5.22 或更新版本。"

msgid ""
"MLX supports text and multimodal language models. llama.cpp uses each "
"parallel slot's context window to choose the scaling factor; increasing "
"``n_parallel`` does not increase that factor. Existing scaling settings in "
"GGUF metadata take precedence over automatic settings."
msgstr ""
"MLX 支持文本和多模态语言模型。llama.cpp 按每个并行槽的上下文窗口选择扩展倍数；增加 ``n_parallel`` 不会增加该倍数。GGUF"
" 元数据中已有的扩展设置优先于自动设置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:9
msgid ""
"The launch dialog fills model-declared loading defaults into matching "
"controls. Settings without a dedicated control appear under advanced engine "
"parameters. Explicit edits and saved launch configurations take precedence. "
"Switching engines replaces automatically filled defaults while preserving "
"user changes. Structured defaults retain their JSON types in requests and "
"saved configurations."
msgstr ""
"加载对话框会将模型声明的默认加载配置填入对应控件，没有专用控件的设置会出现在高级引擎参数中。用户修改和已保存的加载配置优先。切换引擎时，只替换自动填入的默认值，并保留用户修改。结构化默认参数在请求和保存的配置中保留"
" JSON 类型。"
